        "hasAudio": false,
        "text": "Modern vehicles generate massive amounts of performance data every second—most of which vanishes unseen into the cloud.\nAxiome turns the smartphone into an active interface between human and machine. Combining an automated logbook, precision driver training, and a global community for comparing driving styles, it hands data sovereignty and control back to the driver.",
