      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Design",
        "statement": "Visually, the identity radically breaks with slick startup aesthetics. Raw dot-matrix elements and disruptive symbolism balance digital precision with analog tactility, sparking an instant chain reaction: from “What is this?” to “Sounds intriguing” to “I need it.”",
